American AI startups are routing far more app traffic to Chinese large language models. Through OpenRouter, weekly token consumption was mostly driven by U.S. models throughout much of 2025, but from early 2026, Chinese models suddenly became the main growth engine. This indicates that the AI model market is becoming less about brand loyalty and more about raw utility.

